# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# NEONAMP
# Everything listed here is a secret, someone's audio library, a build
# artefact, or state the server recreates on its own. Paths starting with
# "/" are anchored to the project root.
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ── secrets ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# twitch-auth.json holds live OAuth access and refresh tokens.
# twitch-config.json holds the app clientSecret.
# Both are read with a safe fallback and rewritten by the /twitch
# console, so a fresh clone just reconnects.
/twitch-auth.json
/twitch-config.json
.env
.env.*

# ── your library, not the project's ───────────────────────────────────
# server.js recreates music/, playlists/, playlist-media/ and
# youtube-cache/ on boot (fs.mkdir recursive), so ignoring them
# wholesale is safe.
/music/
/playlists/
/playlist-media/
/youtube-cache/
/radio-stations.json

# ── runtime state and caches ──────────────────────────────────────────
# Queue, track position, volume, EQ curve — rewritten every few seconds.
/settings.json
/loudness-cache.json

# ── bundled ffmpeg ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# ~100 MB each: over GitHub's hard per-file limit. Install ffmpeg on PATH
# instead, or drop these back in beside server.js.
/ffmpeg.exe
/ffplay.exe
/ffprobe.exe

# ── metadata sidecars ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Written beside the source audio, wherever that lives.
*.neonamp.json

# ── dependencies ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# package-lock.json is deliberately NOT ignored — it pins the install.
node_modules/

# ── desktop shell build output ────────────────────────────────────────
# Also covered by desktop/.gitignore; repeated here so a clone of the
# root alone still stays clean.
/desktop/target/
/desktop/icon/preview.png

# ── logs, editors, OS litter ──────────────────────────────────────────
*.log
npm-debug.log*
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
